#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD1131 expect=skipped domain=AE
#note "R-4 (ruled 2026-08-19): the pre-ruling Domains [ALL] scope admitted Events/Interventions datasets and fired on every baseline-flagged row because --STRESC cannot exist there (the false-positive flood the ruling ends). AE is EVENTS, outside the aligned Classes [FINDINGS, FINDINGS ABOUT] scope -> the rule no longer runs here."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset AE class=EVENTS label="Adverse Events"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col AESEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col AETERM  type=Char label="Reported Term for the Adverse Event"
col AEBLFL  type=Char label="Baseline Flag (nonstandard use)"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | AE | 01-701-1015 | 1 | HYPERTENSION | Y
